This bundle is a derivative of Z-Image-Turbo by Tongyi-MAI
(https://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications made to the original model:
- Started from ONNX exports of the transformer, text encoder and VAE decoder,
  split into segments that fit the Hexagon NPU's per-context memory limit.
- Graph edits: fixed sequence length (80 text tokens), fixed output sizes
  (1024x1024, 1184x896, 896x1184, 1344x768, 768x1344), explicit clipping of
  selected activations, removal of an identity ScatterElements.
- Quantized to A16W8 (16-bit activations, 8-bit per-row weights) with a
  selected set of tensors kept in FP16, using the Qualcomm AI Runtime (QAIRT)
  SDK 2.48.0.260626.
- Compiled to QNN HTP context binaries for SM8750 (HTP v79). They will not
  run on other chips.

This bundle contains no Qualcomm software. The QNN runtime libraries are
shipped inside the companion Android app, as the QAIRT license permits.

The resulting outputs differ numerically from the original FP32/BF16 model.
